sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student as 🎓 Student User
    participant UI as 🖥️ Streamlit UI
    participant ADK as ⚙️ ADK Coordinator
    participant Scout as 🎯 Job Scout Agent
    participant Resume as 🔒 Private Resume Agent (Gemma 4)
    participant Validator as ⚖️ Claim Validator
    participant Consent as 🛡️ Privacy Consent Gate
    participant Skills as 🛠️ Skill Builder (Gemini / Python)

    Note over Student,UI: Step 1: Find Target Opportunity
    Student->>UI: Search Opportunities (Role, Location)
    UI->>ADK: execute_action(FIND_OPPORTUNITIES)
    ADK->>Scout: Query Provider (Live Adzuna / Mock)
    Scout-->>ADK: Return opportunities with parsed requirements
    ADK-->>UI: Display opportunities (LIVE / DEMO DATA tags)
    Student->>UI: Select Target Role (e.g., AI Engineering Intern)

    Note over Student,Resume: Step 2: Private Local Resume Analysis
    Student->>UI: Upload / Paste Resume
    Student->>UI: Click "Analyze Resume Privately"
    UI->>ADK: execute_action(PREPARE_RESUME, LocalResumeContext)
    ADK->>Resume: Analyze locally (Raw Resume + Target Opportunity)
    Note over Resume: Ollama (gemma4:12b) extracts skills & evidence
    Resume->>Validator: Validate rewrite suggestions
    Validator-->>Resume: Reject unsupported claims (0 hallucinations)
    Resume-->>ADK: Return ResumeAnalysis (Structured Evidence)
    Note over ADK: Raw resume text discarded from workflow state
    ADK-->>UI: Display Demonstrated vs Missing Requirements

    Note over Student,Skills: Step 3: Skill Building & Learning Roadmap
    Student->>UI: Toggle "Cloud Sharing Consent" (Non-PII Gaps)
    Student->>UI: Select Duration (2 or 4 Weeks) & Click "Build Learning Plan"
    UI->>ADK: execute_action(BUILD_SKILLS)
    ADK->>Consent: Check user consent & assert_cloud_safe()
    alt Consent Granted
        Consent->>Skills: Send CloudPlanningContext (Target role & missing skills only)
        Note over Skills: Gemini Flash synthesizes roadmap & portfolio project
    else Consent Declined
        Consent->>Skills: Route to local DeterministicPlanningLLM
        Note over Skills: Offline Python planner synthesizes standard milestones
    end
    Skills-->>ADK: Return SkillBuilderPlan
    ADK->>ADK: create_action_plan(state)
    ADK-->>UI: Render Final Career Action Plan with Portfolio Project
    UI-->>Student: Review Actionable Career Roadmap
